  "components": "(u_r, u_z, u_theta); grad_u[i][j] = d u_i / d (r, z)_j (meridional derivatives only)",
  "sigma": "3x3, rows/columns (r, z, theta); sigma_sym = 2 mu eps - p I, sigma_lap = mu grad u - p I with grad u including the hoop entries (r,theta) = -u_t/r and (theta,theta) = u_r/r",
  "f": "-div sigma_form - gamma grad div u (= -div sigma_form for these divergence-free fields)",
  "traction": "g = sigma_form n, (sigma n)_i = sigma_ij n_j, n the outward unit normal (n_r, n_z, 0)",
  "weights": "volume integrals int (.) r dr dz, boundary integrals int (.) r ds; physical 3D values carry a further factor 2 pi"
 },
